{"version":1,"content":"<p>《親愛的X》金裕貞與《未知的首爾》朴珍榮合演的韓國有線頻道tvN劇集《百日謊言》，以1932年朝鮮日治時期為背景，講述女扒手為了實現夢想，化身翻譯員在朝鮮總督府做密探，與朝鮮政務總監養子兼翻譯官，發展一段充滿謊言的諜戰愛情。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.325750+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T08:48:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:58:11.291086+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"b8ea0bb7eebb07c7bffa5aab62891d078ab34a3ee3a8bdf334073bffa0c9453e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}